# Smoke run: one round against the CPU, from the start screen.
# Run it with `mise run smoke` (README.md, "Scripted runs").
# One step per line: <frame> <command> [argument]. See src/script.rs.
seed 42

30 screenshot start-screen
40 expect state splash
50 start
60 expect state in-game
61 expect phase draw
62 expect round 1
90 screenshot first-turn

# Player 1: draw, attack with the first card, the CPU defends.
100 advance
110 expect phase play
120 pick 1
130 expect phase end
140 screenshot after-attack
150 advance

# The CPU draws and attacks; Player 1 defends with the first card.
160 expect phase battle
170 screenshot cpu-attacks
180 pick 1
200 expect round 3
201 expect phase draw
230 screenshot second-round
240 exit
